risk_factors:
The captain’s control of the vessel as it approached the pier;  Procedures, guidance, crew training, and managerial oversight provided by 
Seastreak LLC, the managing owner and operator of the Seastreak Wall Street and 
similar ferries; 
 Control of passenger access to stairways;  Control panel design;
 Development and implementation of an effective safety management system (SMS); 
and
 The value of information captured by a voyage data recorder (VDR) in accident 
investigation.

outcome:
Injuries 1 fatal, 1 injured (both BAE Systems employees)
Damage to vessels Carnival Triumph, $2.7 million;
Environmentaldamage None

weather:
Variable visibility from 0.25 to 4 miles due to patchy, directional fog/low clouds; 
calm seas, light winds about 2 knots, air temperature 56°F, water temperature 
52°F
